{"title": "Spider meat", "pageid": 28393, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spider_meat", "categories": ["Transcripts", "Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Spider_meat.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Spider_meat.png/350px-Spider_meat.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Spider_meat.png/525px-Spider_meat.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Spider_meat.png/700px-Spider_meat.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Spider_meat.png/350px-Spider_meat.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"350\" height=\"215\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Spider_meat.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Spider meat</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Spider Meat</b> is an interactable spider carcass found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Act 2\">Act 2</a>. \n</p>\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">A well-chewed spider carcass oozes on the ground.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The spider meat can be found near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/38px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/50px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yurgir's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\">Yurgir's</a> lair, off to the side. When interacted with, the party notice the meat is well-chewed and oozing on the ground. The party can sniff the meat:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DARK URGE]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Inhale the noxious aroma.</i></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span><i>Take a good long sniff.</i></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>It is also possible to study it:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[INVESTIGATION]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Study it.</i>&nbsp;(DC 14)</span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[ARCANA]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Scan the meat for signs of magical interference.</i>&nbsp;(DC 16)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[SORCERER]&nbsp;[WARLOCK]&nbsp;[WIZARD]&nbsp;[ARCANA]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Scan the meat for signs of magical interference.</i>&nbsp;(DC 16&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/30px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/40px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DRUID]&nbsp;[RANGER]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Inspect the bite marks more closely to see if you can identify what made them.</i></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>Successfully passing both checks reveals that the spider meat has been tainted with succubus spittle, and that a certain feline creature, (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nessa\" title=\"Nessa\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/25px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/38px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/50px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nessa\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/25px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nessa\" title=\"Nessa\">Nessa</a>), has been indulging in the meat.\n</p><p>Perhaps most interestingly, the interacting party member can even lick it:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DARK URGE]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Indulge in a lick of the raw carrion.</i></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DARK URGE]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Sup once more upon the flesh.</i></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span><i>Give it a lick.</i></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span><i>Lick it again.</i></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>Licking it causes the interacting party member to make a passive <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;6 Constitution Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;6 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> check to avoid being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Spider_Meat)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Spider Meat) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Spider_Meat)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Spider Meat) (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10 turns and learn the meat has been poisoned with succubus spittle. A random party member reacts with disgust. If the party member licks the spider meat again, they are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> with no chance to prevent it.\n</p><p>Learning the meat is poisoned with succubus spittle makes it possible to persuade or deceive the <a href=\"/wiki/Displacer_Beast\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Displacer Beast\">Displacer Beast</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nessa\" title=\"Nessa\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/25px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/38px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/50px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nessa\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png/25px-Portrait_Nessa.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Portrait_Nessa.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nessa\" title=\"Nessa\">Nessa</a>, potentially having her attack <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/38px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/50px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yurgir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\">Yurgir</a>. \n</p><p>Successful inspection of the spider meat grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Mating_Season\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mating Season\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Mating_Season\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Mating Season</a> to characters with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/30px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/40px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guild Artisan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Guild Artisan</a> background.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Companion_approval\">Companion approval</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Licking the spider meat (up to twice): <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/26px-Gale_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/39px-Gale_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/52px-Gale_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/26px-Gale_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #cc3f49 ;\">-1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/26px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/39px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/52px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/26px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #cc3f49 ;\">-1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/26px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/39px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/52px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/26px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/26px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/39px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/52px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/26px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images